 ide\, under the outdoor canopy\, between buildings 400 &amp\; 500.</p><p> 
  For faster check-in\, download the "MySRJC App" and register with Redwood
  Empire Food Bank prior to the event.</p><p>  Don't forget to bring your o
 wn grocery bags\, some will be provided on a first come first serve basis.
 </p><p>  Can't make it? Leftover produce and other items are moved to the 
 Welcome &amp\; Connect Center after each event.</p>
