 per-writing features\, including the capability to create papers via Googl
 eDocs.&#160\;</p><p>  This NoodleTools workshop will focus on the MLA cita
 tion style\, which is typically used in the English\, ESL\, Humanities\, P
 hilosophy\, and Religion disciplines.&#160\;</p><p><a href="https://santar
 osa.libcal.com/event/16679272" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more inf
 ormation and to register\, visit their website here!</a></p>
