CREATED:20260423T184414Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260423T184414Z
UID:6407-1778320800-1778342400@www.petalumamuseum.com
SUMMARY:Celebrating Petaluma Adobe Living History Day
DESCRIPTION:Petaluma Adobe State Historic Park – Photo ©2015\, California State Parks.\nDate:  Saturday May 9\, 10:00-4:00 PM\nVenue: Petaluma Adobe State Historic Park\n3325 Adobe Road\, Petaluma\nAdmission to the park includes all activities.\nView the Petaluma Adobe State Historic Park website\nStep Back in Time at the Petaluma Adobe! California State Parks invites you to celebrate Petaluma Adobe Living History Day. This family friendly event brings 1840’s Mexican California to life inside and outside the two-story adobe walls of General Vallejo’s rancho headquarters. \n \n090-P89773 Petaluma Adobe State Historic Park – ©2015\, Ca. State Parks.  Photo by Brian Baer\nMeet the vaqueros\, traders\, cooks\, and craftspeople who lived in Mexican California. Walk among living history volunteers\, adorned in beautiful\, authentic clothing\, and watch entertaining historical skits that reveal stories of the past. Learn basket weaving and candle-making techniques. Make a piece of rope and play games. Observe the intricate process of making lace. \n \n090-P89886 Petaluma Adobe State Historic Park – ©2015\, Ca. State Parks.  Photo by Brian Baer\n  \n  \n  \n 
URL:https://www.petalumamuseum.com/calendar-event/celebrating-petaluma-adobe-living-history-day/
LOCATION:Petaluma Adobe State Historic Park\, 3325 Adobe Road\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94954\, United States
CATEGORIES:Event,History Trails Walks,NHPM
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.petalumamuseum.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Living-History-Day-Photo.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Petalumamuseum": "https://www.petalumamuseum.com/calendar-event/discover-the-petaluma-danish-soldiers-club/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:petalumamuseum
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T140000
DTSTAMP:20260504T202150
CREATED:20260408T212001Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T235535Z
UID:6344-1778324400-1778335200@www.petalumamuseum.com
SUMMARY:Discover the Petaluma Danish Soldiers Club
DESCRIPTION:Date:  Saturday May 9\, 11:00-2:00 PM\nVenue: Danish Soldier’s Club of Northern California\n4560 Kastania Rd\nPetaluma\, CA 94952\nLunch will be served at 12:30 pm\, if interested.\n(Please register for lunch 7 days in advance\, served at 12:30 pm)\nRegister for Lunch\nTo RSVP click here and select the Danish Soldiers Club Visit on Saturday May 9th\nFounded 88 years ago\, the Petaluma Danish Soldiers Club has quietly been part of Petaluma’s cultural and civic life for nearly a century. Located on Kastania Road\, the club has long served as a gathering place for people of Danish and Scandinavian heritage\, and for the wider community. You’re invited to visit us from 11:00 am to 2 pm. At 11:30 am\, Club President Tim Knudsen will give a short presentation on the club’s history. \n \n \nCome visit this largely hidden in plain sight building and institution in Petaluma. The Club President\, Tim Knudsen\, will offer a short presentation on the club’s history and its role in the community at 11:30 am. Lunch will be served at 12:30 p\, if interested. If you plan to stay for lunch\, and we truly hope you can\, please purchase your meal seven days in advance. There is no option to purchase lunch tickets on the day of the event\, and no outside food is permitted. \n \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 
URL:https://www.petalumamuseum.com/calendar-event/discover-the-petaluma-danish-soldiers-club/
LOCATION:Petaluma Danish Soldiers Club\, 4560 Kastania Rd\, Petaluma\, California\, 94952\, United States
CATEGORIES:Event,History Trails Walks,NHPM
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.petalumamuseum.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Image-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
