SUMMARY: The Petaluma Chorale Spring Concert Series - A Tapestry of Sound
DESCRIPTION:The Petaluma Chorale Spring Concert Series – A Tapestry of So
 und\n\nThe Petaluma Chorale is a mixed vocal ensemble dedicated to the ar
 t of superior choral singing\, including formal\, jazz\, Broadway and oth
 er contemporary styles.\n\nMade up of community members of all ages that 
 share a love of singing. We work in 16 week sessions in the fall and spri
 ng culminating in at least two performances per session. We’d love for yo
 u to join us!
