 ;fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js\, fjs)\;})(window\, document\, 'script'\, 
 'qgiv-embedjs')\; Here Comes the Sun: A Last Chance for the Climate and a 
 Fresh Chance for Civilization Our climate\, and our democracy\, are meltin
 g down. But Bill McKibben\, one of the first to sound the alarm about the 
 climate crisis\, insists the moment is also full of possibility. Energy fr
 om the sun and wind is suddenly the cheapest power on the planet and growi
 ng faster than any energy source in history—if we can keep accelerating 
 the pace\, we have a chance. There’s no guarantee we can make this chang
 e in time\, but there is a hope—in McKibben’s eyes\, our best hope for
  a new civilization: one that looks up to the sun\, every day\, as the sta
 r that fuels our world. #block-1817c64a51f1410d87e7 { --tweak-text-block-r
