DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260722T120000
DTSTAMP:20260317T231109Z
URL:https://www.petalumabounty.org/events/weekly-volunteer-hours-wednesday
 s-2026-04-08-2026-04-15-2026-04-22-2026-04-29-2026-05-06-2026-05-13-2026-0
 5-20-2026-05-27-2026-06-03-2026-06-10-2026-06-17-2026-06-24-2026-07-01-202
 6-07-0-15-2026-07-22/
SUMMARY:Weekly volunteer hours - Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Volunteer on the farm on Wednesdays\, 9am-noon. Tasks typically
  include weeding\, seeding\, mulching\, planting\, and when it's the seaso
 n\, harvesting. It's a great way to get out and help grow fresh\, healthy 
